  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Putrid Penetration\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Putrid-penetration.png\" title=\"Image:Putrid-penetration.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Putrid-penetration.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"42\" src=\"/images/recovered/Putrid-penetration.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Ranger\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Deals Poison damage, chance to knock down\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>A putrid shot that penetrates through your enemies potentially knocking each one down as it passes through them.  It does Poison Damage on each impact.\n</p><p><b>Requires:</b> Ranged Weapon\n</p><p><b>Cool Down:</b> 10 Seconds\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>A putrid shot that penetrates and knocks down multiple enemeies doing X Poison Damage on each impact.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p>\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 25\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 35\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 45\n</td><td> 50\n</td><td> 55\n</td><td> 60\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 30-45\n</td><td> 36-54\n</td><td> 42-64\n</td><td> 49-73\n</td><td> 55-82\n</td><td> 61-92\n</td><td> 67-101\n</td><td> 73-110\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 121.1\n</td><td> 193.3\n</td><td> 157.6\n</td><td> 175.8\n</td><td> 194.0\n</td><td> 212.2\n</td><td> 230.5\n</td><td> 248.7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 27840\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">10\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">14\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">15\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 65\n</td><td> 70\n</td><td> 75\n</td><td> 80\n</td><td> 85\n</td><td> 90\n</td><td> 95\n</td><td> 100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 80-120\n</td><td> 86-129\n</td><td> 92-138\n</td><td> 98-148\n</td><td> 104-157\n</td><td> 111-166\n</td><td> 117-176\n</td><td> 123-185\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"b